-- **A rule reaches the base a block holds only where the block does** (MS11
-- phase 301). `inside` is written in the block and may call
-- `stumbles`; `outside` is written after it and may not, so the file is refused
-- when it loads rather than at the moment `outside` is run.
rule base leaky where

consult test.modules.Quiet where
  rule inside :- do
    call stumbles

rule outside :- do
  call stumbles
